[{"s":24,"a":24,"en":"On a Day when their tongues, their hands and their feet will bear witness against them as to what they used to do.","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(On a) Day"],["تَشۡهَدُ","will bear witness"],["عَلَيۡهِمۡ","against them"],["أَلۡسِنَتُهُمۡ","their tongues"],["وَأَيۡدِيهِمۡ","and their hands"],["وَأَرۡجُلُهُم","and their feet"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَانُواْ","they used"],["يَعۡمَلُونَ","(to) do"]]},{"s":93,"a":11,"en":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it].","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for"],["بِنِعۡمَةِ","(the) Favor"],["رَبِّكَ","(of) your Lord"],["فَحَدِّثۡ","narrate"]]},{"s":98,"a":7,"en":"Indeed, they who have believed and done righteous deeds - those are the best of creatures.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and do"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","those"],["هُمۡ","they"],["خَيۡرُ","(are the) best"],["ٱلۡبَرِيَّةِ","(of) the creatures"]]},{"s":52,"a":41,"en":"Or have they [knowledge of] the unseen, so they write [it] down?","w":[["أَمۡ","Or"],["عِندَهُمُ","with them"],["ٱلۡغَيۡبُ","(is) the unseen"],["فَهُمۡ","so they"],["يَكۡتُبُونَ","write (it) down"]]},{"s":29,"a":69,"en":"And those who strive for Us - We will surely guide them to Our ways. And indeed, Allah is with the doers of good.","w":[["وَٱلَّذِينَ","And those who"],["جَٰهَدُواْ","strive"],["فِينَا","for Us"],["لَنَهۡدِيَنَّهُمۡ","We will surely,guide them"],["سُبُلَنَاۚ","(to) Our ways"],["وَإِنَّ","And indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["لَمَعَ","surely (is) with"],["ٱلۡمُحۡسِنِينَ","the good-doers"]]},{"s":37,"a":45,"en":"There will be circulated among them a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring,","w":[["يُطَافُ","Will be circulated"],["عَلَيۡهِم","among them"],["بِكَأۡسٖ","a cup"],["مِّن","from"],["مَّعِينِۭ","a flowing spring"]]},{"s":20,"a":126,"en":"[Allah] will say, \"Thus did Our signs come to you, and you forgot them; and thus will you this Day be forgotten.\"","w":[["قَالَ","He will say"],["كَذَٰلِكَ","Thus"],["أَتَتۡكَ","came to you"],["ءَايَٰتُنَا","Our Signs"],["فَنَسِيتَهَاۖ","but you forgot them"],["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","and thus"],["ٱلۡيَوۡمَ","today"],["تُنسَىٰ","you will be forgotten"]]},{"s":53,"a":17,"en":"The sight [of the Prophet] did not swerve, nor did it transgress [its limit].","w":[["مَا","Not"],["زَاغَ","swerved"],["ٱلۡبَصَرُ","the sight"],["وَمَا","and not"],["طَغَىٰ","it transgressed"]]},{"s":111,"a":3,"en":"He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame","w":[["سَيَصۡلَىٰ","He will be burnt"],["نَارٗا","(in) a Fire"],["ذَاتَ","of"],["لَهَبٖ","Blazing Flames"]]},{"s":17,"a":43,"en":"Exalted is He and high above what they say by great sublimity.","w":[["سُبۡحَٰنَهُۥ","Glorified is He"],["وَتَعَٰلَىٰ","and Exalted is He"],["عَمَّا","above what"],["يَقُولُونَ","they say"],["عُلُوّٗا","(by) height"],["كَبِيرٗا","great"]]},{"s":27,"a":69,"en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Travel through the land and observe how was the end of the criminals.\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["سِيرُواْ","Travel"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","the land"],["فَٱنظُرُواْ","and see"],["كَيۡفَ","how"],["كَانَ","was"],["عَٰقِبَةُ","(the) end"],["ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ","(of) the criminals"]]},{"s":77,"a":43,"en":"[Being told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\"","w":[["كُلُواْ","Eat"],["وَٱشۡرَبُواْ","and drink"],["هَنِيٓـَٔۢا","(in) satisfaction"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كُنتُمۡ","you used to"],["تَعۡمَلُونَ","do"]]},{"s":26,"a":142,"en":"When their brother Salih said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah?","w":[["إِذۡ","When"],["قَالَ","said"],["لَهُمۡ","to them"],["أَخُوهُمۡ","their brother"],["صَٰلِحٌ","Salih"],["أَلَا","Will not"],["تَتَّقُونَ","you fear (Allah)"]]},{"s":51,"a":45,"en":"And they were unable to arise, nor could they defend themselves.","w":[["فَمَا","Then not"],["ٱسۡتَطَٰعُواْ","they were able to"],["مِن","[of]"],["قِيَامٖ","stand"],["وَمَا","and not"],["كَانُواْ","they could"],["مُنتَصِرِينَ","help themselves"]]},{"s":45,"a":20,"en":"This [Qur'an] is enlightenment for mankind and guidance and mercy for a people who are certain [in faith].","w":[["هَٰذَا","This"],["بَصَـٰٓئِرُ","(is) enlightenment"],["لِلنَّاسِ","for mankind"],["وَهُدٗى","and guidance"],["وَرَحۡمَةٞ","and mercy"],["لِّقَوۡمٖ","for a people"],["يُوقِنُونَ","who are certain"]]},{"s":58,"a":21,"en":"Allah has written, \"I will surely overcome, I and My messengers.\" Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.","w":[["كَتَبَ","Allah has decreed"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah has decreed"],["لَأَغۡلِبَنَّ","Surely,I will overcome"],["أَنَا۠","I"],["وَرُسُلِيٓۚ","and My Messengers"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["قَوِيٌّ","(is) All-Strong"],["عَزِيزٞ","All-Mighty"]]},{"s":78,"a":15,"en":"That We may bring forth thereby grain and vegetation","w":[["لِّنُخۡرِجَ","That We may bring forth"],["بِهِۦ","thereby"],["حَبّٗا","grain"],["وَنَبَاتٗا","and vegetation"]]},{"s":110,"a":3,"en":"Then exalt [Him] with praise of your Lord and ask forgiveness of Him. Indeed, He is ever Accepting of repentance.","w":[["فَسَبِّحۡ","Then glorify"],["بِحَمۡدِ","with (the) praises"],["رَبِّكَ","(of) your Lord"],["وَٱسۡتَغۡفِرۡهُۚ","and ask His forgiveness"],["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed,He"],["كَانَ","is"],["تَوَّابَۢا","Oft-Returning"]]},{"s":8,"a":18,"en":"That [is so], and [also] that Allah will weaken the plot of the disbelievers.","w":[["ذَٰلِكُمۡ","That (is the case)"],["وَأَنَّ","and that"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah (is)"],["مُوهِنُ","one who makes weak"],["كَيۡدِ","(the) plan"],["ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","(of) the disbelievers"]]},{"s":2,"a":15,"en":"[But] Allah mocks them and prolongs them in their transgression [while] they wander blindly.","w":[["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["يَسۡتَهۡزِئُ","mocks"],["بِهِمۡ","at them"],["وَيَمُدُّهُمۡ","and prolongs them"],["فِي","in"],["طُغۡيَٰنِهِمۡ","their transgression"],["يَعۡمَهُونَ","they wander blindly"]]},{"s":108,"a":3,"en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["شَانِئَكَ","your enemy"],["هُوَ","he (is)"],["ٱلۡأَبۡتَرُ","the one cut off"]]},{"s":92,"a":13,"en":"And indeed, to Us belongs the Hereafter and the first [life].","w":[["وَإِنَّ","And indeed"],["لَنَا","for Us"],["لَلۡأٓخِرَةَ","(is) the Hereafter"],["وَٱلۡأُولَىٰ","and the first (life)"]]},{"s":46,"a":14,"en":"Those are the companions of Paradise, abiding eternally therein as reward for what they used to do.","w":[["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","Those"],["أَصۡحَٰبُ","(are the) companions"],["ٱلۡجَنَّةِ","(of) Paradise"],["خَٰلِدِينَ","abiding forever"],["فِيهَا","therein"],["جَزَآءَۢ","a reward"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَانُواْ","they used to"],["يَعۡمَلُونَ","do"]]},{"s":14,"a":41,"en":"Our Lord, forgive me and my parents and the believers the Day the account is established.\"","w":[["رَبَّنَا","Our Lord"],["ٱغۡفِرۡ","Forgive"],["لِي","me"],["وَلِوَٰلِدَيَّ","and my parents"],["وَلِلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","and the believers"],["يَوۡمَ","(on) the Day"],["يَقُومُ","will (be) established"],["ٱلۡحِسَابُ","the account"]]},{"s":112,"a":3,"en":"He neither begets nor is born,","w":[["لَمۡ","Not"],["يَلِدۡ","He begets"],["وَلَمۡ","and not"],["يُولَدۡ","He is begotten"]]},{"s":40,"a":71,"en":"When the shackles are around their necks and the chains; they will be dragged","w":[["إِذِ","When"],["ٱلۡأَغۡلَٰلُ","the iron collars"],["فِيٓ","(will be) around"],["أَعۡنَٰقِهِمۡ","their necks"],["وَٱلسَّلَٰسِلُ","and the chains"],["يُسۡحَبُونَ","they will be dragged"]]},{"s":26,"a":53,"en":"Then Pharaoh sent among the cities gatherers","w":[["فَأَرۡسَلَ","Then sent"],["فِرۡعَوۡنُ","Firaun"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡمَدَآئِنِ","the cities"],["حَٰشِرِينَ","gatherers"]]},{"s":99,"a":7,"en":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it,","w":[["فَمَن","So whoever"],["يَعۡمَلۡ","does"],["مِثۡقَالَ","(equal to the) weight"],["ذَرَّةٍ","(of) an atom"],["خَيۡرٗا","good"],["يَرَهُۥ","will see it"]]},{"s":39,"a":34,"en":"They will have whatever they desire with their Lord. That is the reward of the doers of good -","w":[["لَهُم","For them"],["مَّا","(is) what"],["يَشَآءُونَ","they wish"],["عِندَ","with"],["رَبِّهِمۡۚ","their Lord"],["ذَٰلِكَ","That"],["جَزَآءُ","(is the) reward"],["ٱلۡمُحۡسِنِينَ","(of) the good-doers"]]},{"s":45,"a":7,"en":"Woe to every sinful liar","w":[["وَيۡلٞ","Woe"],["لِّكُلِّ","to every"],["أَفَّاكٍ","liar"],["أَثِيمٖ","sinful"]]}]